BT /F2 18 Tf 263.08 777.89 Td (Abstract) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 751.89 Td (Blood donation is a critical healthcare support activity. In emergency situations,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 735.89 Td (patients and hospitals often need to find suitable blood donors quickly. Manual donor) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 719.89 Td (records, phone-based coordination and unorganized request tracking can delay this) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 703.89 Td (process. The Blood Donation System is developed to reduce these difficulties by) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 687.89 Td (providing a web-based platform for donors, users and administrators.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 671.89 Td (The system allows users to register, login, request blood, track request status and) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 655.89 Td (search for donors. Donors can update their profile, view assigned requests, respond) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 639.89 Td (to notifications and check donation activity. Administrators can manage donor records,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 623.89 Td (approve and monitor blood requests, notify matching donors, maintain blood inventory,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 607.89 Td (view expiry alerts, list user accounts and handle chat support conversations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 591.89 Td (The project uses React for the frontend interface, Express.js and Node.js for backend) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 575.89 Td (APIs, and MySQL for persistent data storage. Passwords are stored using salted hashes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 559.89 Td (The system also includes validation, role-based navigation and automatic expiry status) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 543.89 Td (handling for blood inventory.) Tj ET
endstream
