BT /F2 18 Tf 258.76 777.89 Td (Chapter 1) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 751.89 Td (Introduction) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 54.00 729.89 Td (1.1 Introduction) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 706.89 Td (Blood is an essential medical resource required during surgeries, accidents,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 690.89 Td (childbirth complications, cancer treatments and many emergency cases. A successful) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 674.89 Td (blood donation process depends on the availability of donors, accurate donor details,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 658.89 Td (quick communication and proper tracking of requests.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 642.89 Td (The Blood Donation System is a web application named Blood Bridge. It connects) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 626.89 Td (patients, normal users, donors, hospitals and administrators through a single) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 610.89 Td (organized platform. The application provides public pages, login and registration,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 594.89 Td (donor search, blood request forms, admin dashboards and support chat features.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 54.00 572.89 Td (1.2 Problem Statement) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 549.89 Td (In many situations, blood donor information is maintained manually or through) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 533.89 Td (scattered contact lists. This creates problems such as outdated donor records,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 517.89 Td (delayed donor matching, lack of request status visibility, poor inventory tracking) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 501.89 Td (and difficulty in contacting the responsible administrator. These problems become) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 485.89 Td (serious during emergency blood requirements.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 54.00 463.89 Td (1.3 Objectives) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 440.89 Td (- To develop a web-based platform for managing donors, users and administrators.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 424.89 Td (- To allow users and donors to submit normal or emergency blood requests.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 408.89 Td (- To help administrators match requests with suitable donors based on blood group.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 392.89 Td (- To maintain blood inventory with units, hospitals, status and expiry dates.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 376.89 Td (- To provide notifications for donor responses and inventory expiry alerts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 360.89 Td (- To provide chat support between users/donors and administrators.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 54.00 338.89 Td (1.4 Scope of the Project) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 315.89 Td (The scope of this project includes user registration, donor registration, role-based) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 299.89 Td (login, donor search, blood request submission, admin request management, donor) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 283.89 Td (notification handling, blood inventory maintenance, expiry alerts, profile updates,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 267.89 Td (password changes and support conversations.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 54.00 245.89 Td (1.5 Technologies Used) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 222.89 Td (Layer Technology Purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 206.89 Td (Frontend React, React Icons, CSS User interface and dashboards) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 190.89 Td (Backend Node.js, Express.js REST API and business logic) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 174.89 Td (Database MySQL Persistent storage) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 158.89 Td (Security Crypto PBKDF2 hashing Password hashing with salt) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 142.89 Td (Configuration dotenv Environment based settings) Tj ET
