BT /F2 18 Tf 258.76 777.89 Td (Chapter 2) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 751.89 Td (Literature Review and Existing System) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 54.00 729.89 Td (2.1 Literature Review) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 706.89 Td (Healthcare management systems are designed to improve speed, accuracy and reliability) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 690.89 Td (in medical services. Blood donation management is one of the important areas where) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 674.89 Td (digital systems can reduce delays. A computerized system can store donor details,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 658.89 Td (search donors by blood group and location, track requests and notify responsible) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 642.89 Td (users.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 626.89 Td (Modern web applications usually use a frontend framework, backend API and relational) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 610.89 Td (database. This separation improves maintainability. React helps create reusable) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 594.89 Td (components and dashboards, Express.js supports API endpoints and MySQL provides) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 578.89 Td (structured storage for donor, request, inventory and account records.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 54.00 556.89 Td (2.2 Existing System) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 533.89 Td (In a manual blood donation process, donor details may be stored in notebooks,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 517.89 Td (spreadsheets or phone contacts. When a request arrives, the administrator must) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 501.89 Td (manually search for donors and call them individually. Request status may not be) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 485.89 Td (visible to the requester, and inventory expiry may be missed if records are not) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 469.89 Td (checked regularly.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 54.00 447.89 Td (2.3 Disadvantages of Existing System) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 424.89 Td (- Donor records can become outdated or duplicated.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 408.89 Td (- Searching donors manually takes more time.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 392.89 Td (- Users cannot easily track their request status.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 376.89 Td (- Inventory expiry dates are difficult to monitor manually.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 360.89 Td (- Communication between donor, user and admin is not centralized.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 344.89 Td (- Manual records are less secure and more difficult to back up.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 54.00 322.89 Td (2.4 Proposed System) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 299.89 Td (The proposed Blood Donation System provides an online interface for all major roles.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 283.89 Td (Users can request blood and search donors. Donors can manage profiles and respond to) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 267.89 Td (assigned requests. Administrators can create donor accounts, approve requests, notify) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 251.89 Td (matching donors, update request progress, maintain blood stock and communicate through) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 235.89 Td (chat support.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 54.00 213.89 Td (2.5 Advantages of Proposed System) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 190.89 Td (- Centralized MySQL database for donor, user, request and inventory data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 174.89 Td (- Role-based dashboards for admin, donor and user.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 158.89 Td (- Faster donor matching using blood group and donor records.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 142.89 Td (- Inventory expiry alerts for expired or soon-expiring stock.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 126.89 Td (- Secure password storage using salted hash values.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 110.89 Td (- Support chat conversation history for user assistance.) Tj ET
endstream
