BT /F2 18 Tf 258.76 777.89 Td (Chapter 7) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 751.89 Td (Conclusion and Future Enhancement) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 54.00 729.89 Td (7.1 Conclusion) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 706.89 Td (The Blood Donation System successfully provides a web-based solution for organizing) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 690.89 Td (blood donation activities. It reduces manual record keeping by storing donors,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 674.89 Td (users, requests, inventory and support conversations in a MySQL database. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 658.89 Td (role-based dashboards make the system easier to use for administrators, donors and) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 642.89 Td (normal users.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 626.89 Td (The project demonstrates practical use of React, Express.js, Node.js and MySQL.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 610.89 Td (It also includes important application features such as password hashing, profile) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 594.89 Td (management, donor matching, request notifications and expiry alerts.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 54.00 572.89 Td (7.2 Limitations) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 549.89 Td (- The system currently uses dashboard notifications instead of SMS or email delivery.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 533.89 Td (- Hospital accounts are not implemented as a separate role.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 517.89 Td (- Location matching is text-based and does not use maps or distance calculation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 501.89 Td (- Advanced analytics and printable admin reports are not fully automated.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 54.00 479.89 Td (7.3 Future Enhancements) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 456.89 Td (- Add SMS and email notifications for urgent blood requests.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 440.89 Td (- Add hospital role with hospital-specific request and stock management.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 424.89 Td (- Integrate map-based donor search using location distance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 408.89 Td (- Add PDF report generation for donor lists, request history and inventory reports.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 392.89 Td (- Add appointment scheduling for blood donation campaigns.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54.00 376.89 Td (- Deploy the project to a cloud server for real-world access.) Tj ET
